  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det omfattar finansiering av en organisationsgenomg&#xe5;ng av HIVOS, en organisation till vilken ambassaden f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rvarande bereder ett fyra&#xe5;rigt st&#xf6;d. Genomg&#xe5;ngen g&#xf6;rs av EMM i enlighet med Sidas riktlinjer f&#xf6;r riskanalys vilka f&#xf6;reskriver att potentiella avtalspartners system f&#xf6;r intern styrning och kontroll ska genomlysas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is for an Organisational Assessment of HIVOS, an organisation undergoing an appraisal  for a four-year grant. The  exercise is being conducted by EMM in accordance with Sida&apos;s guidelines on risk analysis which prescribe the assessment of a potential agreement partner&apos;s internal management and control systems.</narrative>
  </description>
